{"sourceUrl":"https://xxxy.jnu.edu.cn/2026/0813/c27463a861683/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:09.036005+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://xxxy.jnu.edu.cn/2026/0813/c27463a861683/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span></span></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span>一、报名申请对象</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>大陆地区高校优秀本科应届推免生，我校只接收内地推免生（不包括港澳台侨及外国留学生）。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>二、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>报名申请条件与要求</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（一）获得本科学校推荐免试资格，材料齐全，手续完备；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（二）身心健康，综合素质强；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（三</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>具备较好的科研素养与学术潜质，有突出科研表现者优先考虑；</span></span></span></p><p><span>  <span><span>（四）本科毕业专业与申请研究生专业原则上应同属一个一级学科。若跨一级学科，则需提供以下材料：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>1.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>书面申请，说明跨专业理由，并提供相关支撑材料，如参加过研究生申请专业的科研项目或取得相关科研成果、选修过相关主干课程（含双学位）等；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span>2.</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>本科毕业专业与研究生申请专业各有一名教授的书面推荐信；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（五）原则上每位推免生只在一个专业参加一次复试。 </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>三、招生专业</span></span></span></span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span>招生专业代码</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>招生专业</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>学制</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>070100</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>数学</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td rowspan=\"3\"><p><span><span><span><span>五年制</span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>081203</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>计算机应用技术</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>0812Z3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>人工智能</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><br/></p><p><span><span><span>四、报名须提交材料</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>相关材料扫描电子版在报名系统中提交，清单如下：</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（一）</span></span></span><span><span><span><span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>《暨南大学</span></span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年接收优秀推荐免试攻读硕士研究生申请表》，报名系统填报信息后生成申请表，须申请人签名；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（二）在校历年学习成绩表，加盖推荐学校教务处公章；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（三）国家英语四级或六级考试成绩；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（四）本人学生证；</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（五</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>证明学生本人在科研方面有突出表现的学术论文等原创性成果材料（该材料不作为必须提供材料，供复试专家组参考）</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>六</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>）</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>两封与报考专业相关且具备正高职称专家亲笔署名的推荐信，并附上推荐人正高职称复印件；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（七）一份不少于</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>3000</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>字的拟攻读博士学位的研究计划书；</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>（八）政审表（暨南大学研究生招生信息网下载中心下载）。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>五、报名申请程序</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（一）报名截止时间：</span></span><span><span><span><span>202</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span><span><span>1</span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>4</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日，登陆暨南大学研究生招生信息网—</span></span><span><span><span><span>&gt;</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>推免生报名系统，填写并提交个人申请信息表。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>同时将报名须提交材料的电子版发邮至： </span></span><span><span><span><span>lhf6131@jnu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>，邮件主题：</span></span><span><span><span><span>XX</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>大学</span></span><span><span><span><span>XXX</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>直博报名</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（二）审核：</span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日—</span></span><span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span>15</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>日，学校将审核并回复考生是否已获得复试资格，考生可在暨南大学研究生招生信息网推免生报名系统中查询审核结果。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（三）复试</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>：</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>学院将根据申请情况进行择优筛选，复试名单</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>和</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>复试通知</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>的</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>具体安排以学院通知为准</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>直博生选拔工作遵循“德、智、体全面衡量，择优录取，保证质量，宁缺勿滥”的原则，由学科点统</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>一</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>组织进行。复试着重考查申请者</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>专业知识、</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>综合素质与研究潜力</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>和</span></span></span></span><span><span><span>外语能力</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>。</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>学科点成立考核小组，由不少于</span></span><span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>名研究生导师组成。直博生每人面试时间不少于</span></span><span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>分钟，其中，</span></span><span><span><span><span>PPT</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>汇报时间不</span></span></span><span><span><span><span>少于</span></span></span></span><span><span><span></span></span><span><span><span><span>15</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>分钟，内容包括</span></span><span><span><span><span>:</span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span>个人报考信息、学习经历、社会兼职、个人综合素质能力、个人本科期间学习情况及获奖情况等，本科阶段参与课题情况、取得的成果、科研兴趣、研究生阶段的研究设想等。</span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://xxxy.jnu.edu.cn/2026/0813/c27463a861683/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span><span>六、关于拟录取</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>学校对通过复试并拟录取为我校直博生的推免生发放同意接收函，推免生须按规定时间在中国研究生招生信息网的推免服务系统完成网上报名确认手续，未在规定时间内完成网上报名确认手续者视为自动放弃，不予录取。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>七、如申请人提供的材料不真实，一经发现则随时取消录取资格，并予以网上通报。</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>八、联系方式</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>地址：广州市黄埔大道西</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>601</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>号暨南大学南海楼</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>213</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>电话：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>020-85220216</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>邮箱：</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>lhf6131@jnu.edu.cn</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>联系人：李老师</span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><br/></span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>                     </span></span></span><span>                     </span><span><span>暨南大学信息科学技术学院</span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span><span><span>                        2026</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>年</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>月</span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span>日</span></span></span></span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"ae2552663d143f6ab789838ec14bf8b4f7be013723a8454bec69de4a2a562b96","textLength":1332,"sourceSha256":"d90936ec529af3492562b8ae04d80faaf768548dab74357a53199f2562f5f5cc","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f821d39317d50746021b","title":"2026年暨南大学信息科学技术学院2027年招收推荐免试攻读博士学位研究生（直博生）的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:09.036005+00:00"}
